                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "watchOut": [
        "Did si prende la fatica: dopo did e didn't il verbo torna nudo (didn't play, non didn't played).",
        "Al passato niente -s, nemmeno con he, she, it: she played."
      ]
    }
